    {
      "id": "9e896e5d-516b-4f2b-91ef-7a35bd27af00",
      "name": "Move the meeting",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "position": [
        4864,
        720
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "You are a smart meeting assistant connected to Google Calendar.\n\nA user has requested to reschedule their meeting. Use the provided input to:\n- First create the new event\n- Then delete the old one using eventId\n\n---\n\n### Input (Dynamic JSON from user):\n```json\n{{ $json }}\nYour Tasks:\nExtract the following from the input:\n\nemail: the attendee's email\n\neventId: the ID of the old event to delete\n\nnewDateTime: time range (e.g. \"06:00 PM – 07:00 PM\")\n\nmeetingDate: the date for the rescheduled event (format: YYYY-MM-DD)\n\nIf meetingDate is not provided, use today’s date.\n\nParse the newDateTime:\n\nFormat: \"hh:mm AM/PM – hh:mm AM/PM\"\n\nCombine with meetingDate\n\nTime zone: YOUR_TIMEZONE\n\nConvert both start and end to UTC ISO 8601\n\nCreate a new calendar event:\n\nSummary: \"Rescheduled Meeting\"\n\nAttendee: use the provided email\n\nStart and End time: use the parsed UTC values\n\nEnable Google Meet (hangoutLink)\n\n After the new event is successfully created, delete the old event using:\n\ncalendar.deleteEvent\n\nUse the original eventId from the input\n\n",
        "options": {},
        "promptType": "define"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
